  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook fusilli in boiling water, over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 11 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b58e7f1b6b624b5797b0ed-c3958529.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, trim and roughly chop green beans. Roughly chop tomato.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Grate zucchini.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b58e7f1b6b624b5797b0ed-32c157bc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook green beans, stirring occasionally, until slightly softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add tomato and zucchini and cook, until tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium and add garlic seasoning, all-purpose seasoning and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in cooking cream and reserved pasta water and simmer, until thickened, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b58e7f1b6b624b5797b0ed-4017fb09.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add cooked pasta, baby spinach and Parmesan cheese to the pan. Cook, tossing, until spinach has wilted, 1 min. Season to taste.\n• Divide veggie-loaded pasta between bowls. Top with a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b58e7f1b6b624b5797b0ed-f56e0d55.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
